WEBVTT

00:15.563 --> 00:17.940
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

00:19.150 --> 00:22.444
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

00:22.820 --> 00:26.114
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

00:26.366 --> 00:30.866
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

00:33.331 --> 00:36.667
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

00:36.751 --> 00:40.337
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

00:40.421 --> 00:44.921
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

00:49.555 --> 00:54.055
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

00:56.604 --> 00:59.982
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

01:00.066 --> 01:04.566
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

01:17.208 --> 01:21.708
EPISODE 3
THE NIJIMURA BROTHERS, PART 1

01:19.294 --> 01:21.900
Yeah. We've taken care of Angelo.

01:23.798 --> 01:25.841
But it'll be a while
till I'm back.

01:26.634 --> 01:28.969
That other photo
we've been looking into…

01:29.387 --> 01:31.514
I'd like you to send it my way.

01:32.307 --> 01:35.601
Yeah, the one the Speedwagon
Foundation obtained in Egypt

01:35.685 --> 01:37.311
ten years back.

01:37.645 --> 01:39.897
I think I might've figured it out.

01:40.690 --> 01:41.440
Later then.

01:43.651 --> 01:46.528
<i>And it's all thanks to him.</i>

01:47.822 --> 01:52.322
Josuke! I killed your grandpa,
but you can't put me to death!

01:54.912 --> 01:59.412
If you kill me, you'll end up
cursed, like yours truly!

02:03.588 --> 02:06.924
Didn't your mommy ever
teach you it's rude to point?

02:08.468 --> 02:11.804
M-M-My hand! My hand!

02:12.347 --> 02:14.766
No one's going to execute you.

02:15.058 --> 02:17.393
Not me or Mr. Jotaro, here.

02:18.019 --> 02:20.187
For you, there will be no execution,

02:20.563 --> 02:22.398
and no incarceration.

02:22.774 --> 02:24.567
Josuke, you handle the rest.

02:25.026 --> 02:28.404
Wh-What the hell you
gonna do, you bastards?!

02:28.780 --> 02:30.907
Enjoy your
eternal penance, Angelo!

02:31.199 --> 02:32.909
Contemplate the life
you took from Grandpa

02:32.992 --> 02:34.785
and everyone else you killed!

02:44.921 --> 02:46.589
Goddamn you!

02:47.256 --> 02:49.675
I wouldn't get too cocky,
little shit!

02:50.009 --> 02:54.509
He'll butcher you both
soon enough!

02:55.139 --> 02:56.849
What? "He"?

02:57.100 --> 02:59.977
You got it.
The one in a school uniform…

03:00.144 --> 03:02.354
The one
who gave me this power.

03:03.106 --> 03:03.856
What?

03:04.607 --> 03:05.357
You don't mean…

03:05.775 --> 03:08.861
You saying there's someone who can
bestow the power of the Stand?

03:09.195 --> 03:10.237
Scared?

03:11.239 --> 03:14.325
Huh? What's so scary bout that?

03:14.534 --> 03:18.079
No… Angelo wasn't born
a Stand user.

03:18.621 --> 03:22.416
No one knew how he
obtained his powers.

03:22.750 --> 03:26.754
But if there's a person
who can impart Stands onto others…

03:27.004 --> 03:28.922
Petrifying, isn't it?

03:30.049 --> 03:31.633
Wanna know more?

03:34.762 --> 03:39.262
It was last year, 1998,

03:40.101 --> 03:43.938
on a night about a month
before my execution.

03:45.189 --> 03:48.567
That night,
I couldn't sleep worth a damn…

03:48.985 --> 03:52.947
I just sat there,
staring off into the darkness.

03:53.698 --> 03:56.742
It was dead quiet.

03:57.243 --> 03:58.827
But then…

04:01.622 --> 04:05.417
in that shitty hole of
a solitary cell,

04:05.626 --> 04:07.044
he was there.

04:08.129 --> 04:10.631
The guy in the school uniform.

04:11.466 --> 04:13.676
The hell!
When'd you get here?!

04:13.801 --> 04:14.885
How'd you get in here?!

04:18.431 --> 04:19.181
Wha…

04:19.432 --> 04:22.017
He was holding
an ancient bow and arrow.

04:22.351 --> 04:25.854
It must've been
hundreds of years old.

04:26.189 --> 04:27.773
Wh-What the hell
are you doing?

04:28.065 --> 04:32.069
I was scared spit less.
My balls hid inside my stomach.

04:32.320 --> 04:34.947
And before I could
let out a scream…

05:00.431 --> 05:01.557
You survived.

05:01.974 --> 05:02.975
Congratulations.

05:03.559 --> 05:05.352
You have talent.

05:05.853 --> 05:07.855
Otherwise, you'd be dead.

05:09.482 --> 05:13.068
You just acquired yourself
a special ability.

05:13.945 --> 05:18.445
Or… perhaps I should say
I extracted it from your soul.

05:19.200 --> 05:22.161
The more wicked the criminal,
the more talent he holds…

05:22.453 --> 05:26.953
A talent a man named DIO once
referred to as a "Stand."

05:32.046 --> 05:32.880
DIO?

05:33.047 --> 05:34.173
Did you say DIO?

05:34.882 --> 05:36.592
Mr. Jotaro?
Is something…

05:39.720 --> 05:40.387
What?!

05:40.471 --> 05:41.555
You fools!

05:41.889 --> 05:43.432
You were so captivated
by my story,

05:43.724 --> 05:46.101
you completely forgot about
my Aqua Necklace!

05:46.394 --> 05:47.436
Angelo, you bastard!

05:47.728 --> 05:48.478
Josuke!

05:48.688 --> 05:50.981
Get me the hell
out of this rock now!

05:53.859 --> 05:55.819
At the moment,
my heart says…

05:56.237 --> 05:59.615
my level of fury
is insufficient.

05:59.949 --> 06:00.950
What're you doing?!

06:01.409 --> 06:03.494
Quit fooling with
your stupid-ass hair!

06:03.953 --> 06:05.371
You're dead, brat!

06:05.830 --> 06:07.957
I said get me
the hell outta here!

06:10.334 --> 06:11.668
My "what"?

06:11.919 --> 06:13.211
Take it easy,
Josuke!

06:13.754 --> 06:15.464
What did you call my hair?

06:15.715 --> 06:17.758
Y-You know…
If you kill me,

06:18.092 --> 06:20.052
the school uniform guy'll
hunt you down!

06:20.428 --> 06:22.680
He lives in this town, too!

06:22.888 --> 06:25.557
What? Josuke, wait!

06:42.783 --> 06:45.285
My level of pissed-off-ness
just wasn't right before.

06:46.329 --> 06:50.829
And I had to turn the dick-wad
into a really great statue.

06:54.837 --> 06:55.879
Good grief.

06:56.714 --> 06:59.216
We needed him
to keep talking.

06:59.759 --> 07:02.678
Huh? You actually
believe all that crap?

07:02.928 --> 07:06.806
It wasn't crap.
He was talking about DIO.

07:07.016 --> 07:09.143
Who is that, anyway?

07:09.644 --> 07:13.856
The Joestars have been fighting him
for over a hundred years.

07:14.482 --> 07:18.235
I, together with my allies,
battled and defeated DIO.

07:19.737 --> 07:21.989
But one thing
remains a mystery.

07:22.490 --> 07:26.990
Why, in 1987,
did DIO suddenly gain a Stand?

07:29.080 --> 07:31.832
So you think that same guy
turned him into a Stand user?

07:32.124 --> 07:32.874
Yeah…

07:33.125 --> 07:34.501
And I think we have
our new enemy.

07:35.127 --> 07:36.586
The school uniform guy.

07:37.046 --> 07:40.799
Or it could be
that bow and arrow.

07:43.761 --> 07:46.180
<i>If it's hiding
somewhere in this town…</i>

07:46.889 --> 07:51.389
<i>Then Angelo was
just the beginning.</i>

07:54.522 --> 07:55.898
<i>Good grief..</i>

07:56.857 --> 08:01.357
MORIOH MUNICIPAL RECORDS

08:05.574 --> 08:07.576
<i>It's like Jotaro said</i>

08:08.536 --> 08:11.914
<i>Something evil is
lurking in this town.</i>

08:12.123 --> 08:14.708
<i>A catastrophic danger is
fast approaching…</i>

08:15.376 --> 08:17.753
<i>No, it's already here.</i>

08:18.379 --> 08:20.798
<i>The number of missing persons
reported in Morioh</i>

08:20.881 --> 08:24.218
<i>has reached 81 this year,
1999, alone.</i>

08:21.090 --> 08:25.590
KIDNAPPINGS AND ABDUCTIONS
HAVE YOU SEEN THIS PERSON?

08:24.844 --> 08:27.263
<i>45 of which were children.</i>

08:27.555 --> 08:28.889
<i>Even if some were runaways,</i>

08:29.181 --> 08:32.559
<i>that's still seven to eight times more
than the national average.</i>

08:32.893 --> 08:34.561
<i>It's an outrageous number.</i>

08:35.229 --> 08:36.104
<i>Not to mention…</i>

08:38.232 --> 08:40.234
<i>Josuke's grandfather…</i>

08:42.236 --> 08:44.696
Hey, Koichi, you're studying
after school's out?

08:45.114 --> 08:46.323
Let's go.

08:47.575 --> 08:49.201
Oh, yeah.

08:50.202 --> 08:53.246
<i>Phew, that's a relief
Josuke seems to be feeling better.</i>

09:01.088 --> 09:02.130
Yo, Angelo.

09:02.423 --> 09:05.259
Uh… Huh? Hey,
was this rock always here?

09:05.718 --> 09:08.053
Yeah, but it didn't look
like this at first.

09:08.471 --> 09:09.472
At first?

09:11.140 --> 09:13.392
Well, okay.
Hi, Angelo…

09:16.479 --> 09:19.732
By the way,
what happened to Jotaro?

09:20.107 --> 09:22.984
Um, he said he needed to
look into something.

09:23.110 --> 09:24.694
He's staying at
the Grand Hotel.

09:24.945 --> 09:26.863
Think it has to do
with this town?

09:27.323 --> 09:28.991
Sure seems like it.

09:29.492 --> 09:30.493
I see.

09:35.122 --> 09:36.832
<i>The crisis facing this town…</i>

09:48.010 --> 09:50.053
Huh? Josuke?

09:51.180 --> 09:54.892
Hasn't this house been
abandoned for three or four years?

09:56.811 --> 09:59.980
Yeah. Can't imagine any one'd
ever buy this dilapidated dump.

10:00.189 --> 10:02.232
Might as well bulldoze it
and build another.

10:02.483 --> 10:04.151
No, someone's living here.

10:04.652 --> 10:05.986
Maybe they just moved in.

10:06.362 --> 10:08.364
I just saw someone
in the window.

10:08.572 --> 10:10.532
Huh?
Nah, that's impossible.

10:11.033 --> 10:12.367
Forget I live
right over there?

10:12.618 --> 10:14.703
I'd notice
if someone moved in.

10:14.995 --> 10:16.788
Besides,
I always see real estate guys

10:16.872 --> 10:19.040
patrolling around
looking out for squatters.

10:20.292 --> 10:22.836
Now that you mention it…

10:23.003 --> 10:27.503
How peculiar.
Maybe I just saw a ghost…

10:28.551 --> 10:31.262
H-Hey,
quit talking like that.

10:31.595 --> 10:34.556
Ghosts spook me out!
Remember, I live right there!

10:43.190 --> 10:46.860
Keep your nose outta
people's business, little brat.

10:43.941 --> 10:47.402
BILLION

10:48.112 --> 10:49.696
Nothing to say?

10:49.905 --> 10:50.947
Koichi!

10:51.198 --> 10:53.033
Hey! What the hell do
you think you're doing?

10:53.576 --> 10:56.453
What? You took the words
right out of my mouth.

10:57.121 --> 10:59.498
You're on my property…

11:03.460 --> 11:07.464
MORIOH LANDMARK 1
ANGELO'S ROCK
ONE MINUTE WALK FROM
MORIOH JOZENJI STREET BUS STOP #3.
ANGELO'S ROCK: TOWN LANDMARK AND
HOT-SPOT FOR ROMANTIC RENDEZVOUS.
FOR YEARS IT'S CHARMED
THE RESIDENTS OF MORIOH,
DESPITE ITS SLIGHTLY
DISTURBING APPEARANCE.

11:14.680 --> 11:15.931
Enough already!

11:16.265 --> 11:18.600
If it's about the newspaper,
I already told you we don't need it.

11:23.230 --> 11:24.439
Who the hell…?!

11:24.857 --> 11:27.109
Look, I just lost
my dad to a stroke,

11:27.401 --> 11:30.195
and I'm still picking up
the pieces, okay?

11:30.946 --> 11:32.113
Come back later, okay?

11:33.782 --> 11:35.492
Y-You're…

11:38.287 --> 11:39.288
Jo…

11:40.205 --> 11:42.123
Joseph!

11:42.583 --> 11:45.460
You finally came back
for me, Joseph!

11:45.836 --> 11:47.629
I've been waiting for you!

11:47.963 --> 11:51.675
I've been so depressed
since dad died!

11:51.967 --> 11:54.928
You came just in the nick of time,
my Joseph!

11:56.263 --> 11:59.307
I love, love, love,
love, love, love,

11:59.433 --> 12:03.562
Sorry to disappoint,
but I'm not Joseph Joestar.

12:04.146 --> 12:04.896
Huh?

12:05.022 --> 12:06.815
Look closer.
See, no wrinkles.

12:06.941 --> 12:09.818
Oh…
Now that you mention it…

12:11.654 --> 12:13.072
You are young!

12:13.530 --> 12:14.697
Good grief…

12:15.115 --> 12:18.618
I'm Joseph's grandson…
Jotaro Kujo.

12:19.453 --> 12:21.329
O-Oh, is that so?

12:21.747 --> 12:23.707
Josuke can fill you in
on the rest.

12:24.458 --> 12:27.252
I can't stand tedious chit chat.

12:28.253 --> 12:29.671
I'm here to see Josuke.

12:30.130 --> 12:30.922
He around?

12:36.637 --> 12:38.805
I said,
where's Josuke?

12:39.056 --> 12:39.765
Huh?

12:39.848 --> 12:44.143
Oh! Josuke still isn't home
from school.

12:44.895 --> 12:47.063
I see…
I'll be back tonight.

12:47.564 --> 12:48.314
Huh?

12:48.399 --> 12:49.691
Leaving already?

12:53.320 --> 12:54.070
Oh…

12:54.738 --> 12:55.989
About your father…

12:56.198 --> 12:56.948
Huh?

12:57.533 --> 12:58.575
It's a shame.

12:59.326 --> 13:02.162
If Joseph Joestar
were here now,

13:02.454 --> 13:04.789
he'd protect you with
every fiber of his being.

13:06.291 --> 13:07.792
But he's an old man now.

13:08.252 --> 13:10.295
I can't let him come here.

13:11.296 --> 13:13.047
I'm here in his stead.

13:19.346 --> 13:21.431
<i>I've got a bad feeling…</i>

13:21.932 --> 13:24.392
<i>That bow and arrow
Angelo was talking about…</i>

13:25.352 --> 13:27.020
<i>And the intel on Enyaba</i>

13:27.104 --> 13:29.272
<i>the Speedwagon Foundation
found in Egypt…</i>

13:31.191 --> 13:34.569
<i>That witch's holding
a bow and arrow</i>

13:35.362 --> 13:38.239
<i>It imparts the power
of the Stand to ordinary people.</i>

13:39.283 --> 13:41.535
<i>This is the last thing we need..</i>

13:45.039 --> 13:47.124
Are you nuts?

13:46.999 --> 13:51.499
NO TRESPASSING

13:47.374 --> 13:48.124
Let him go.

13:48.542 --> 13:51.545
My pop bought this house.

13:51.837 --> 13:54.172
You're not gonna
snoop around here.

13:54.423 --> 13:55.924
Not and get away with it.

13:56.091 --> 13:58.009
You don't quite get it,
do you?

13:58.260 --> 14:00.637
I'm telling you to
let him go, punk.

14:00.929 --> 14:03.389
If you don't,
I'm not gonna be happy.

14:03.724 --> 14:06.268
Hey, now.
"Punk" isn't very nice?

14:06.852 --> 14:08.645
Especially when trespassing

14:08.729 --> 14:11.481
on the property of
a recent acquaintance…

14:11.857 --> 14:14.276
Don't you know
your manners?

14:14.693 --> 14:18.655
I know how to make you
shut that goddamn mouth.

14:21.909 --> 14:22.993
What?!

14:25.329 --> 14:26.621
Bro?!

14:28.082 --> 14:30.793
Interested as to why
I shot him with the arrow?

14:31.126 --> 14:34.087
Because that goon is
Josuke Higashikata.

14:34.379 --> 14:37.131
That so?
So it's him…

14:38.092 --> 14:40.719
He defeated Angelo,

14:41.095 --> 14:44.056
which means his Stand abilities
pose a nuisance to us as well.

14:45.265 --> 14:46.724
You know
about Stands?!

14:46.809 --> 14:48.185
So you two are
Stand users!

14:48.644 --> 14:50.062
Okuyasu!

14:50.145 --> 14:52.313
Make Josuke Higashikata
disappear!

14:56.068 --> 14:57.235
Koichi…

14:58.362 --> 15:01.698
Hmph! I had high hopes he'd turn
into a Stand user,

15:01.782 --> 15:03.658
and a useful one, at that.

15:03.951 --> 15:05.160
Alas, all was for naught.

15:05.619 --> 15:06.995
He's about to
kick the bucket.

15:11.416 --> 15:12.166
M-Move!

15:12.459 --> 15:16.004
I can still heal him
with Shining Diamond!

15:17.089 --> 15:17.881
I don't think so…

15:24.513 --> 15:25.972
Josuke Higashikata!

15:26.473 --> 15:28.850
I, Okuyasu Nijimura,
will make you disappear.

15:29.143 --> 15:31.186
Behold, The Hand!

15:36.859 --> 15:37.901
Get ready!

15:45.617 --> 15:48.786
Get outta the way,
or I'll mangle that ugly mug.

15:51.248 --> 15:53.416
Pretty fast…

15:54.334 --> 15:56.127
Hey, Okuyasu.

15:56.837 --> 15:58.088
It appears
manipulating a Stand is

15:58.172 --> 16:00.924
a lot like driving a car
or motorcycle.

16:01.675 --> 16:04.052
Any bumbling half-wit

16:04.344 --> 16:06.429
can get in the driving seat
of muscle machine.

16:06.763 --> 16:10.057
But he'll still be
too scared to drive!

16:10.642 --> 16:11.517
Bro…

16:11.768 --> 16:14.562
Why'd you have to go and
say mean stuff like that?

16:15.147 --> 16:17.858
This bastard's
faster than I thought.

16:18.275 --> 16:20.986
May I remind you,
this is no game, Okuyasu!

16:21.528 --> 16:23.947
The mere thought of
your Stand, The Hand,

16:24.031 --> 16:27.325
once sent chills down my spine.

16:27.659 --> 16:29.577
Pull yourself together
and wield thy Stand.

16:29.953 --> 16:33.873
Kill Angelo's murderer,
Josuke Higashikata!

16:34.541 --> 16:37.502
He will prove to be
a troublesome one.

16:38.712 --> 16:39.879
I know–

16:40.297 --> 16:43.091
Hey!
I was talking back there!

16:43.383 --> 16:44.759
Th-That's not fair!

16:45.469 --> 16:47.387
Not too bright, are you?

16:47.763 --> 16:49.222
What? Why?!

16:49.348 --> 16:50.682
What makes you say–

16:51.683 --> 16:53.226
I said move.

16:55.062 --> 16:55.812
Koichi!

16:57.648 --> 16:59.608
Thank god.
You're still alive!

17:00.025 --> 17:01.234
Then I can still save…

17:01.568 --> 17:05.113
That's it!
You're not getting away!

17:05.447 --> 17:06.906
I said move!

17:07.241 --> 17:09.076
Get any closer and
I'll really get pissed!

17:09.409 --> 17:13.246
Go ahead and try!
If you've got the guts, that is!

17:18.919 --> 17:19.669
<i>Bastard!</i>

17:19.920 --> 17:22.756
<i>He's got way too much
confidence in his right hand</i>

17:24.007 --> 17:24.966
<i>Shit.</i>

17:25.342 --> 17:28.303
<i>That right hand..
Something tells me… Shit!</i>

17:30.305 --> 17:32.932
Let go of my right hand,
sonuvabitch!

17:33.350 --> 17:34.476
So it is his right hand!

17:44.695 --> 17:46.029
You bastard…

17:46.571 --> 17:48.656
Stay right there,
Josuke!

17:49.074 --> 17:50.992
You can't just leave
your friend behind!

17:51.785 --> 17:54.287
Something's definitely up
with your right hand.

17:54.663 --> 17:57.332
My gut says there's more
than meets the eye.

17:58.458 --> 18:00.793
You can ponder all you want
after you're dead!

18:01.336 --> 18:02.795
This is it!

18:03.213 --> 18:06.007
<i>Koichi.. Hang in there just
a little longer…</i>

18:10.220 --> 18:12.138
<i>That gate…
Something's not right.</i>

18:12.472 --> 18:15.224
NO __ PASSING

18:12.889 --> 18:15.246
<i>No… passing?</i>

18:23.358 --> 18:26.694
I'd stop trying to
back up, prick.

18:27.154 --> 18:30.031
You're moving farther away
from your little friend.

18:30.615 --> 18:32.867
Come a little bit closer!

18:34.536 --> 18:36.621
<i>That's it…
The sign's missing "tres"!</i>

18:36.913 --> 18:40.416
Your Stand's right hand
couldn't have made

18:41.126 --> 18:42.669
part of that sign disappear,
could it?

18:42.836 --> 18:44.629
It cuts out space in midair!

18:47.632 --> 18:50.259
Righto, Josuke Higashikata!

18:50.677 --> 18:53.763
Its right hand makes
disappear whatever it grabs.

18:54.306 --> 18:56.224
But the void left behind…

18:57.184 --> 19:00.145
Closes! Pulling together the space
as if nothing happened!

19:00.187 --> 19:02.939
NO __ PASSING

19:00.312 --> 19:02.960
But the part that my hand
takes away…

19:03.440 --> 19:07.735
Well, I don't have a freakin' clue
where the hell it ends up!

19:11.156 --> 19:15.076
Try to run away,
and I can do this, too.

19:20.374 --> 19:23.752
I grab a little space! And then…

19:27.339 --> 19:28.715
Whad'ya know? You come right to me!

19:29.091 --> 19:31.009
Just like teleporting!

19:36.348 --> 19:40.727
Behold, the Stand that even
my bro fears, The Hand!

19:40.977 --> 19:43.104
You can't run now,

19:43.480 --> 19:44.647
Josuke!

19:46.358 --> 19:47.734
No matter
where you try to hide…

19:48.860 --> 19:49.610
you're always…

19:50.987 --> 19:53.280
within my reach!

19:58.453 --> 19:59.495
Weakling!

19:59.830 --> 20:03.166
That's how you beat Angelo?

20:12.426 --> 20:15.053
Guess you never figured out
how worthless you are.

20:15.470 --> 20:17.472
Not too bright, huh?!

20:19.766 --> 20:24.266
– Now die, Josuke!
– You really are dumb, aren't you?

20:25.021 --> 20:25.771
What?!

20:43.457 --> 20:44.541
That was close.

20:45.208 --> 20:46.334
So that was
Okuyasu Nijimura, huh?

20:47.169 --> 20:50.172
Gotta say,
his Stand was pretty great…

20:52.340 --> 20:54.759
It won't be fun when he
wakes up and tries to attack.

20:55.427 --> 20:57.303
So that he stays napping,

20:57.387 --> 21:00.390
some gentle asphyxiation
should do the trick.

21:00.849 --> 21:03.768
This'll put the sting of
defeat in his soul.

21:04.060 --> 21:05.519
Okie dokie…

21:06.605 --> 21:07.856
K-Koichi!

21:12.861 --> 21:14.529
Now you've gone too far…

21:15.197 --> 21:16.031
I'll kill you!

21:26.833 --> 21:31.170
This arrow is irreplaceable.
There's only one, you know.

21:31.546 --> 21:33.839
It's essential to
my mission.

21:36.051 --> 21:37.927
Losing it is not an option.

21:42.224 --> 21:44.100
<i>Angelo's story says it all…</i>

21:44.935 --> 21:48.772
<i>This is the bow and arrow
that unleashed DIO's Stand</i>

21:49.689 --> 21:51.941
<i>There's no doubt.
It released The World..</i>

21:53.443 --> 21:57.363
<i>After Enyaba's death,
someone nabbed the bow and arrow,</i>

21:57.989 --> 21:59.490
<i>creating more Stand users…</i>

22:00.158 --> 22:01.784
<i>right here in Morioh.</i>

22:04.287 --> 22:07.581
We've got to destroy
the bow and arrow fast…

22:08.750 --> 22:10.251
A villain more horrific than DIO…

22:11.253 --> 22:14.464
A Stand user who wields more
power than The World…

22:15.382 --> 22:16.758
Must never walk this earth.

23:38.840 --> 23:42.009
EPISODE 4
THE NIJIMURA BROTHERS, PART 2
